OL,3,GNEWSAThree jailed over death of Army
OL,4,Aveteran
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing a trial at Hull Crown Court
OL,7,Flast month, Lukasz Matusiak, 27, was
OL,8,Fjailed for five years. Britney Naylor,
OL,9,F20, and Shaytoyia Farrow, 21, were
OL,10,Ffound guilty of manslaughter but
OL,11,Fcleared of murder. Both were sent to
OL,12,Fprison for two years.
OL,14,FTwo other defendants, Bethany Naylor,
OL,15,F20, and Kristjan Suits, 35, were found
OL,16,Fnot guilty of manslaughter.
